  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to implement community security initiatives in target communities is a component of Citizen Security and Justice Programme 3 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;9,800,000. It works in the following sector(s): Vocational training, Basic life skills for adults, Civilian peace-building, conflict prevention and resolution, Decentralisation and support to subnational government.</narrative>
